  "title": "Tyson Foods Announces Jeff Schomburger to Succeed Donnie King as President and CEO",
  "summary": "Tyson Foods announced today that Jeff Schomburger has been named President and Chief Executive Officer, effective October 4, 2026. Following a transition period beginning in July, Schomburger will succeed Donnie King, who has had an incredible 43-year career with the company.",
